# The web app is the only thing Vercel builds. Without this the CLI uploads the
# whole monorepo — the Xcode build directories alone are 4.7 GB and blow past
# the 10 MB request limit — even though git ignores them.
#
# Every pattern is ANCHORED with a leading slash. Without it, `firebase` also
# matches apps/web/src/lib/firebase/, which took the build down with 21
# "Can't resolve '@/lib/firebase/auth'" errors.
/apps/ios
/docs
/firebase
/tools
/kyber
